00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.016
- Oh, okay.

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:40.960
I'm gonna go with 2.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:41.793
- 2 it is.

00:01:41.793 --> 00:01:42.698
- Okay.

00:01:42.698 --> 00:01:43.621
(Kelly sighing)

00:01:43.621 --> 00:01:44.490
(audience cheering)

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:46.223
