00:01:47.476 --> 00:01:50.020
This is not my forte.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.110
- Silence.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:51.943
- [Kelly] Okay, okay.

00:01:51.943 --> 00:01:52.776
- Now Kelly-

00:01:52.776 --> 00:01:53.609
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:54.500
